          <p>Acabamento fosco ou brilhante, encaixe perfeito nas câmeras. Para iPhone 14, 15 Pro e principais linhas Android.</p>
          <span class="tag">For iP 14/15 Pro</span>
        </article>

        <article class="product-card">
          <div class="product-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none"><path d="M14 32c0-9 7-16 16-16s16 7 16 16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/><rect x="10" y="30" width="8" height="14" rx="3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/><rect x="46" y="30" width="8" height="14" rx="3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/></svg>
